Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:04.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把路西法放出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Lucifer out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把他再关进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to put him back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆已经不在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和米迦勒 路西法一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam has been locked in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都关在牢笼里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Michael and Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂有问题 它消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹去地狱的记忆我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't erase Sam's hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以将它隔离在屏障之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can put it behind a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续调查 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep digging, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不跟我说说明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna be cryptic, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救萨姆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will save Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但前提是你不能插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only if you stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了 小卡 - 我在交战状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you, Cass? - I'm at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来谈一笔简单的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to discuss a simple business transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没别的 - 你想做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all. - You want to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,成千上万的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all inside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在统统在我身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}millions upon millions of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使之刃对我没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel blade won't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我现在已经不再是天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm not an angel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.75,0:01:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要卑躬屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will bow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你们的主 也就是我 颂扬你们的爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and profess your love unto me, your lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就杀了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or I shall destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:27.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.61,0:01:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就行了吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This good or…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要我们五体投地\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want the whole forehead-to-the-carpet thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:01:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.57,0:02:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不是真心的 又有什么意义呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point if you don't mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们害怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是爱 不是尊敬 只是害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not love, not respect, just fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你还有什么可说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you have nothing to say to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从背后捅了我一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stabbed me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,平身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 得了 这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, come on. This is not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识的卡西迪奥已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Castiel you knew is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要怎样 杀了我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, then? Kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是个勇敢的小东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a brave little ant you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚你无力还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不敢再对我动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't dare move against me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我没必要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I have no need to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少现在不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们背叛我之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}once, you were my favorite pets,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也曾是我最爱的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you turned and bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底是谁 - 我是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I'm God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们安分守己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you stay in your place,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以在我的王国里生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may live in my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们反抗 我就灭了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you rise up, I will strike you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不是很舒服吧 对吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not doing so well, are you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会治好他的 你保证过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you would fix him. You promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你们不插手 可你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stood down, which you hardly did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我的仁慈心存感激吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be thankful for my mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可把你扔回那个牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have cast you back in the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 别这样 这真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, come on, this is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能改变这一切 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can turn this around, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你好 我希望这是你们最后一次见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope, for your sake, this is the last you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你追随拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you followed Raphael,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们反抗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you stood against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定会惩罚你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}punishment is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们无处躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nowhere to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的父亲已经离开很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father left a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:03:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很难熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾以为我们需要的是自由意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the answer was free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要一个强大的领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a firm hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要一个父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我就是你们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am your father now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 你们要听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be obedient, children…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则这就是你们的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}or this will be your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新的纪元\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a new day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于人间和天堂都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}on earth and in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢庆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rejoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在修理她还是在乱喊乱叫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you fixing her or primal screamin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没醒 但还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still under, but alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.89,0:05:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们的新上帝怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about God part deux?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在四处打探消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got all kinds of feelers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还没什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, diddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在找什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what exactly are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问题就在这儿 - 什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇迹 群体产生幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miracles, mass visions,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是玉米饼上出现小风衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}trench coat on a tortilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道我在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 他会露面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, he'll surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, say we do us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,升级版上帝的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}where new and improved flew off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到时候我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell we plan to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no more clue than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道到上哪本书里找资料 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what books to hit for this, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想办法嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事书里肯定没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't in no book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你稍微探个头 小卡就会灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stick your neck out, Cass steps on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我要干什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know what I'm gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这车修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fix this car…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我力所能及的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把她修得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can work on her till she's mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等萨姆醒来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when Sam wakes up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他是副什么德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what shape he's in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们也能帮他恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}we glue him back together, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是咱们该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…恢复得不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you're, uh, walking and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活能自理 完全好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on my own socks … whole nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:06:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, uh, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的没事了吗 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure you're okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,头还有点疼 不过基本恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head hurts a little, but…Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 我也觉得不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Look, man, I'm as surprised as you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我真的没事了 - 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but, yeah, I swear. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.21,0:07:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason putting a gift horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也该知足了 - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- under a microscope, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡那边怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened with Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来帮我一起修车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come help me with the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 边修边跟你讲 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I'll fill you in? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:39.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（宁静教堂 信仰上帝 他就在我们身边）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人宣扬他们所谓的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty speak for them and their so-called lifestyle …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,各路媒体 好莱坞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Media, Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷帝嘎嘎满口都是爱情和金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Gaga won't shut up for love or money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但正因如此 我们才要高声呐喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's why we raise our voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,反对他们所谓的婚礼和葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and picket their so-called weddings and their funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人来传达上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to speak for God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说你传达的就是上帝的旨意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who says you speak for God?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对性取向毫不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am utterly indifferent to sexual orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能对你这样的伪君子纵容姑息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot abide hypocrites like you, reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别闹了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fun's over, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在替我传达旨意之前 你先告诉各位信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your flock where your genitals have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢男人还是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you speak for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的名义撒谎之人 将被自己的榫舌噎死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he who lies in my name shall choke on his own false tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,被自己的恶言出卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his poisonous words shall betray him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是主\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I am the Lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:13.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（松林商场 加州 萨克拉门托）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这下面打盹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, taking a nap down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像有小卡的消息 快来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Cass, we think. Come on. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,约二百名宗教领袖暴毙身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sudden deaths of some 200 religious leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事件正在调查之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}are currently under investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈方面尚未发表声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vatican has yet to issue a statement,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但部分民众已将其称为「神迹」\N{\fnArial\fs30}but some are already calling this an act of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all saw him …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没蓄胡须 没穿长袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}No beard, no robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was young…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 还很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}And … and sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他穿了件风衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a raincoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,据悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believed to be targeted hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,三K党多位高层遇刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}high up in the white-supremacy organizations,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局认为这一白人至上的组织已被迫解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}the FBI now believes the Ku Klux Klan has been forced to disband.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我倒没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't argue with that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早些时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak lightening strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,共鸣启迪中心在一场大火中被烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the heels of the fire that burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后又被诡异的闪电击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}the center for vibrational enlightenment earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,据发言人表示 「这一惨剧是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said a spokesman, "This tragedy represents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,新时代励志演说家史上最大的损失「\N{\fnArial\fs30}the largest loss in new-age motivational speaker history."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,励志演说家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motivational speakers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的小卡没也不比以前的那位更懂反讽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure new Cass gets irony any better than old Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 以前的小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course, old Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会为了表明立场就毁了麦迪逊广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't smite Madison Square Garden just to prove a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他陷得太深了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is off the deep end of the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没打算停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办 再试着跟他谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Try to talk to him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 咱们只能跟那家伙谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, all we can do is talk to the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可不是什么家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是上帝 而且很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's God, and he's pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝私设公堂 你可别去拦着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when God gets righteous, you get the hell out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没读过圣经吗 - 大概如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haven't you read the Bible? - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他骗了咱们 利用了咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has lied to us, he used us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毫不在乎地就推到了你脑袋里的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cracked your gourd like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们已经跟他费尽口舌了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have spent enough on him. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把管钳递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me that socket wrench.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（田纳西州 坚信上帝）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不少人称其为「奇迹般的康复」\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what many are calling a miracle healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们请来了卫生部通讯员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here with me, health correspondent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯·路易斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob Lewitski.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯基 看你能讲出什么道道来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Educate me, Lewitski.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.19,0:12:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你貌似很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我露陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jig is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到我了 - 我一直掌握着你的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You found me. - I never lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这些小伎俩没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}These scratches … they're all useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家总得挣扎两下嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, can't blame a girl for trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭我之前想不想喝两口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fancy a drink before you smite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢速战速决 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like to bend 'em right over, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀你 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to kill you, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留着你还有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么用处 - 接下来这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Here's our new arrangement …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.59,0:12:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饶你不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你重新做回地狱之王 - 但是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You return to your post as King of Hell. - But?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是灵魂的去处由我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I choose where each soul goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 我来掌控灵魂的去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But … - I control the flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你剩多少 你就拿多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you take whatever I give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你想拿大头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you intend to keep the lion's share.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.42,0:13:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是地狱要缩编了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're saying is hell is being downsized.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以把地狱彻底消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done away with it completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我得有东西来要挟我的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need a threat to hold over my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让米迦勒一直待在路西法的牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to keep Michael in Lucifer's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这事我们…没商量的余地吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gather this is not say a, uh, negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 那我非常乐意接受…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Then I graciously accept…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看上去还算不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's looking good… Considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都能当职业选手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should do this professionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近注意萨姆没\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen Sam lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛快点说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子怎么可能还没倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that kid even vertical?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡可是把那堵墙推到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Cass broke his damn pinata.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解当时在实验室他怎么还能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I get how he came to help us, back at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肾上腺素 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Adrenaline. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he says he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只祈求上帝他真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just pray to God it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得换个新说法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to come up with a new saying for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 鲍比 看我们过的这日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, though, Bobby. I mean, look at our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能经受多少打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more hits can we take?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果萨姆说他很好 那就是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if Sam says he's good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.43,0:15:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们一直走背字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we never catch a break,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次怎么会这么幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why would we this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 或许就在这事上 能走点运\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just … just this one thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没那么蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会把期望放太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna get my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再挨当头一棒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to get kicked in the daddy pills again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how you feeling, sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得没话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有家出版社大概在一小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a publishing house literally exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的人真的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, the body count is really getting up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做点什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是找到那个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we got to do is hunt the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我的神枪没了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I lost my God gun, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么别的天堂武器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is there some kind of heavenly weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许用巴尔萨泽从那个天使兵器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe something out of that Angel Arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Balthazar stole?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有东西能对付得了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something that can hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是上帝 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's God, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没东西伤得了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有个人或许可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there might be someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't act so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新老大甚至会因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new boss is gonna kill me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们这帮人说话而杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}even talking to you lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没往你的脏脸上捅刀子你就偷乐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky we're not stabbing you in your scuzzy face,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个混… - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you piece of … - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么新老大 - 卡西迪奥 你们这群白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What new boss? - Castiel, you giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是每个人的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得当他发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think he's gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在密谋逆反 他会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he finds out we've been conspiring?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是打算密谋点什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do want to conspire, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们只想要你帅气的站在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we want you to just stand there and look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一道符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来捆绑死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bind death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,捆绑 控制死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bind? Enslave death?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You having a laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路西法干过 - 因为他是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucifer did it. - That's Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语不分人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spell's a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得你们能够驾驭那样的马力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe you can handle that kind of horsepower?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是痴心妄想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're delusional!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,各路神仙里 只剩下死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is the only player on the board left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有PK小卡的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}that has the kind of juice to take Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他俩都会把我们碾成豌豆泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll both mash us like peas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要帮一个自杀式行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I help on a suicide mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的希望小卡掌控整个宇宙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really want Cass running the universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请施舍点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some help, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please? Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请施舍点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some help, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是名真正的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a true believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都说我充满愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say I'm wrathful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我只惩罚骗子和那些背叛我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I only punish liars and those who forsake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个公平的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a just God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,您说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:18:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁今晚想给死神来个五花大绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who feels like hog-tying Death tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.15,0:19:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正长命百岁也没那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old age is overrated anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西都准备得差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got most of this stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有几样东西还得去跑个腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're gonna have to make a run for a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.53,0:19:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如「借于神迹 封于水晶」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like "An act of God, crystallized forever."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为是指真正的水晶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking it means an actual crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.41,0:19:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当闪电以合适的角度打在沙地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, lightning strikes sand at the right angle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就能自动结晶为完美的形状\N{\fnArial\fs30}it crystallizes into the perfect shape of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电 神迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning … act of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,正解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,得去找块闪电岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got yourself a fulgurite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得找块大的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need a biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 稀罕到可遇不可求吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess … rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一个拍卖记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the records of an auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,中标者距咱这儿这儿九小时车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winning bidder lives about nine hours from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你有芥末酱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. You got any Grey Poupon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,芥末酱 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grey poupon? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑子里就蹦出这玩意儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what popped in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤了你俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,手里有枪的可是我 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one with the firearm, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是威斯医生和夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so this is Dr. and Mrs. Weiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.97,0:22:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到那个神迹什么的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the God thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们就开始仪式吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's light this candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.34,0:23:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.75,0:23:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 死亡骑士 不是看上去那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, death. This isn't what it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去你们把我绑起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like you bound me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有充分理由 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good reason, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就听我们把话说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, hear us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来点儿油炸泡菜片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fried pickle chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.19,0:23:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可是全州最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the best in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我就这么好打发吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That easy to soothe me, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 是跟萨姆的幻觉有关吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about Sam's hallucinations, I assume?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 萨姆 每个人只能竖一次墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sam. One wall per customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.63,0:24:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在给我松绑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now unbind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.25,0:24:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.31,0:24:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事不会有好结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't going to end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想让你终结了上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to kill God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:24:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.93,0:24:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your…Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.57,0:24:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们凭什么认为我办得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.97,0:24:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么我要那么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.46,0:24:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要你做 现在你得听我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said so, and we're the boss of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.32,0:24:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是客气地请你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…Respectfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.86,0:24:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.85,0:24:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.72,0:24:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本不想杀你们 但如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to kill you, but now…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.08,0:24:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀不了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.14,0:24:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的旧情已被你抹得干干净净 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've erased any nostalgia I had for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.48,0:24:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡骑士是我们的小弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is our bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是上帝动手 我们也死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't gonna die, even if God pulls the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.53,0:25:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们果然是令人讨厌的低等生物 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annoying little protozoa, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}"God"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.85,0:25:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 你更像是变异了的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look awfully like a mutated angel to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮囊正在融化 你马上就要爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your vessel's melting. You're going to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.99,0:25:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.11,0:25:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我搞定了手上的事 我自会修复好我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I've finished my work, I'll repair myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.65,0:25:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你办得到是因为你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can because you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.85,0:25:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是无法负荷这么多灵魂 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're simply under the weight of all those souls, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.22,0:25:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那还不是最严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not the worst problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.65,0:25:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炼狱中有着比那些灵魂更加古老的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things much older than souls in purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.73,0:25:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时也一并吞下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you gulped those in, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.03,0:25:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.61,0:25:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自能控制他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 更古老的东西是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … uh, what older things?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,早在上帝创造天使和人类之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long before God created angel and man,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他创造了第一只野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}he made the first beasts …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.35,0:25:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦（圣经中象征邪恶的一种海怪）\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.39,0:25:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathans?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.49,0:25:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人觉得他们其实挺可爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I personally found them entertaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.09,0:25:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他却担心他们会毁了整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was concerned they'd chomp the entire petri dish,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.57,0:25:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他把它们锁了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he locked them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.24,0:25:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你们认为他创造炼狱是要干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think he created purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.66,0:25:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了隔离那些狡慧而又危险的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep those clever, poisonous things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.71,0:26:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如今卡西迪奥已经吞下了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Castiel has swallowed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.30,0:26:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成为了这些古老之物和你们世间的唯一隔膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one thin membrane between the old ones and your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.95,0:26:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个愚蠢至极的兵蛋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid little soldier you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.70,0:26:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.43,0:26:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我敢开启那被他尘封的大门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I dared open a door that he shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.09,0:26:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恪尽职守 替他打点好他的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a service, taking his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.24,0:26:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,恪尽职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.77,0:26:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指平息那场小争斗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settling petty vendettas?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.38,0:26:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.29,0:26:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一次又一次地收拾残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cleaning up one mess after another …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.69,0:26:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无私心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selflessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.56,0:26:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是位慈善家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the humanitarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.85,0:26:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.57,0:26:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你究竟是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.75,0:26:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个苍蝇拍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A flyswatter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.27,0:26:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为 至少注定要拍死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destined to swat you, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.90,0:26:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I take you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙 还真是够王婆卖瓜自卖自夸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really bought his own press, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.95,0:26:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know God,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.81,0:26:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而您呢 不是那个料\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, sir, are no God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.61,0:26:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你们俩就别废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, put your junk away, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.77,0:26:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你怎么喊他都成 快杀了他就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, call him what you want. Just kill him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.95,0:27:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在可以开打了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we kickbox now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感 某人即将命丧我手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a tingle I'd be reaping someone very, very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.58,0:27:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 不是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry … not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.01,0:27:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还挺着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.53,0:27:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我正是为此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.05,0:27:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次参加竞选\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I'm running again …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有义务保护我的选民\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save my constituents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.34,0:27:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,免受对手们那些邪恶政策的摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Godless policies of my opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't have said it better myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.02,0:27:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.18,0:27:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to see the Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.68,0:27:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,事由是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, regarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.45,0:27:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,滥用职权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abuse of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.34,0:27:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的才不是小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.44,0:28:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要惩罚一个借我之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm punishing a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,肆虐贫穷和绝望的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who causes poverty and despair in my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.26,0:28:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将你们的利益置于首位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put your needs first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.47,0:28:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.78,0:28:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人都听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.85,0:28:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是比我父亲更好的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a better God than my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.05,0:28:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要如何才能让你们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I make you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.95,0:28:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.09,0:28:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是专门负责给你收拾烂摊子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to tie your shoes every time you trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.95,0:28:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就警告过你那些灵魂的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you about those souls how long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.90,0:28:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有足够的时间阻止那个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to stop that fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.97,0:28:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are again,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.19,0:28:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的小星球又即将遭受屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your little planet on the edge of immolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.05,0:28:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.02,0:29:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 我一直忙着拯救这个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? I've been trying to save this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.50,0:29:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该去警告个更好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you should find somebody better to tip off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.57,0:29:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该去拯救个更好的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should spend my effort on a better planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.55,0:29:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.50,0:29:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等…等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, h-hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.55,0:29:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我们一些提示吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just … can you give us something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.38,0:29:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你对我们必须有那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you have to care a little bit about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.46,0:29:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点在乎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happens to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.51,0:29:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.79,0:29:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的确觉得那个小天使很傲慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do find that little angel arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.96,0:29:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 就这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Let's go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your only hope is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.13,0:29:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是立刻让他把所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have him return it all to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.95,0:29:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还回炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.08,0:29:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要的所有东西那个实验室里都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have everything you need at that lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.99,0:29:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他回到那 强迫他放弃神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him to return there and compel him to give up the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.16,0:29:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,强迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compel?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.60,0:29:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.03,0:29:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那扇门只在月蚀的时候开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that door only opens in the eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.46,0:29:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.71,0:29:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再做一扇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make another.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,周日早上3点59分\N{\fnArial\fs30}3:59 Sunday morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.25,0:29:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,破晓之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住要准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be punctual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.23,0:29:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别感谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.79,0:29:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的烂摊子收拾好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean up your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.13,0:30:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再绑我一次试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to bind me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动手之前就会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll die before you start.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.37,0:30:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 泡菜片不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice pickle chips, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.95,0:30:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.34,0:31:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要配点咖啡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some coffee with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.51,0:31:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 某些地方现在是晚上六点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's 6:00 p.m. somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.13,0:31:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.25,0:31:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能赶在该死的凌晨3点59分前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how are we supposed to get Cass to that lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.53,0:31:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把小卡带到实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}by friggin' 3:59 a.m.?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.47,0:31:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.43,0:31:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们不用」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "We don't"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.81,0:31:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法把马带到水边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we can't bring the horse to water,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.61,0:31:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也无法逼马喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can't make it drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必自欺欺人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why fool ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.33,0:31:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.94,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你认为小卡已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think that Cass is gone …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.97,0:31:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为他的确走了 - 他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's 'cause he is. - He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.03,0:31:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在内心的某个角落 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in there somewhere, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.41,0:31:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.91,0:31:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你不知道 - 不 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you don't. - No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.19,0:31:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我自己也有段时间魂不守舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, look, I was pretty far gone sometimes myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.51,0:31:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你从来没放弃过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you never gave up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.29,0:31:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 而事实证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and it turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.55,0:31:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是一如既往的开诚布公\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're about the same open book as you've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.32,0:31:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻觉 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallucinations? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.79,0:31:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得从死亡骑士那儿听来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to find out from Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.58,0:31:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.31,0:31:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如坦白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about not lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.88,0:31:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.20,0:31:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那堵墙上都爬了些什么烂七八糟的玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you've got crazy crap climbing those walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.69,0:31:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.39,0:31:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.87,0:32:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近的麻烦事够多的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot of pretty severe crap swinging your way lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.39,0:32:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而…而我认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … and I thought …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.56,0:32:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我何必去破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I thought why burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.85,0:32:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仅存的美好愿望呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one good bubble you had left?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.28,0:32:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.45,0:32:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.92,0:32:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底什么需要你控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, exactly, is under control?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.70,0:32:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能辨别真实与幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's real and what's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.32,0:32:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.90,0:32:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以对付完小卡再议此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, we can debate this once we deal with cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.45,0:32:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我要怎么对付吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know how I'm gonna deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.31,0:32:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会大吃一顿 喝点小酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stuff my piehole, I'm gonna drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.41,0:32:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看点亚洲卡通黄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna watch some asian cartoon porn,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.21,0:32:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,整得像世界要爆炸了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and act like the world's about to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.04,0:32:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.54,0:32:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.15,0:32:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一名身着风衣的男子血洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Massacre at the campaign office of an incumbent senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.44,0:32:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现任参议员竞选办公室「\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a trench-coated man."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.39,0:32:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有安全监控录相\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's security footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.13,0:33:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想召唤小卡已经…不太可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think reaching Cass is, uh…out of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.32,0:33:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这根本没用 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is pointless. Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.37,0:33:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是否还会有一点在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if any part of you even cares,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.87,0:33:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…我仍然视你为自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um, I still think you're one of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.12,0:33:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,无尽的潜意识深处 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, way, way, way off the reservation, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,到明天凌晨 此事还能挽救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we still have till dawn to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.14,0:33:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.11,0:34:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你关了再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if you turn that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.24,0:34:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.39,0:34:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.61,0:34:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了你的召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.32,0:34:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.63,0:34:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,血浆要找对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the right blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.61,0:34:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,过道走到底有个小罐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a small jar end of the hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.42,0:34:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在供给品橱里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}s-supply closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.71,0:34:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.39,0:34:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 还要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you need something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.75,0:34:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:34:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel regret,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.90,0:35:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你 和我对萨姆做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about you and what I did to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.37,0:35:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.49,0:35:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还有时间 如果我还有力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was time, if I was strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会马上治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd … I'd fix him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.26,0:35:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望死前能弥补一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to make amends before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.61,0:35:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.37,0:35:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你觉得舒服点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it make you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.63,0:35:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.28,0:35:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.98,0:35:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.27,0:35:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 看起来都很傻 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It all seems so silly, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.67,0:35:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.62,0:35:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time, no spooning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.95,0:35:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在地狱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.63,0:35:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得非常对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that you're right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.29,0:36:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂肉钩 锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meat hooks…Chains…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.38,0:36:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.20,0:36:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.37,0:36:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我的脑子在释放记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just my brain leaking memories from the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.23,0:36:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那道墙崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause of the wall breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.46,0:36:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.17,0:36:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 你的小理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very good, your little theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.51,0:36:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.92,0:36:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 不是你变得不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this isn't you going guano.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.29,0:36:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你周围的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.77,0:36:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.78,0:36:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.78,0:36:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你跳出囚笼的那一刻起\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the second you sprung out of that lock box.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.45,0:36:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 逃出来是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Escaping was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.89,0:36:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.43,0:36:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是我最好的折磨手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is my best torture yet …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.20,0:36:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你以为你自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}make you believe that you're free and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.19,0:36:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后突然摘下遮眼布\N{\fnArial\fs30}yank the wool off of your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.32,0:36:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没跑出去过 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never left, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.07,0:36:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在囚笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.62,0:37:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.25,0:37:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.77,0:37:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆去哪儿了 时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam? It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.32,0:37:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.87,0:37:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.61,0:37:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 站起来 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, step right up, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.78,0:38:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.26,0:39:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.64,0:39:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身体都冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.53,0:39:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呼吸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.94,0:39:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许天使不需要喘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe angels don't need to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.19,0:39:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.63,0:39:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.66,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你个死孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you child.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.29,0:39:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.20,0:39:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.79,0:39:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.14,0:40:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.44,0:40:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄起来 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him up. Easy, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.45,0:40:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.37,0:40:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我震惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm astonished.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.82,0:40:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you … both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也就是想拯救地球而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were mostly just trying to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.31,0:40:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.29,0:40:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做得太过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really overreached.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.97,0:40:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法向你赎罪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find some way to redeem myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.19,0:40:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 饭要一口一口吃 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, one thing at a time. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you out of here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.67,0:40:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.13,0:40:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.20,0:40:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们去找萨姆 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's go find Sam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.77,0:40:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得马上逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.68,0:40:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挡不住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't hold them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.30,0:40:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡住谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold who back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们留在我体内了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They held on inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他们太强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, they're so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.20,0:41:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是谁 - 利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell! - Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.37,0:41:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扛不住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.60,0:41:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.07,0:41:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 去找到萨姆 去找到萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go get Sam! Go get Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.69,0:41:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.38,0:41:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.21,0:41:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 他消失啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is … he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.40,0:41:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.91,0:41:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们接管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We run the show now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.58,0:41:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会非常非常有趣的啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is going to be so much fun.
